<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	Object list demo, and the demo of a model object carried in the URL:
	the ticketId channel maps the selected ticket onto its identifier and back, and
	<param-bindings> puts that identifier into the address bar below the sidebar item, behind
	the static prefix segment naming what it identifies, so selecting a ticket yields
	/view/tickets/ticket/<id>, opening such a link selects the ticket, and browser
	back/forward walks the selection history. The identifier is percent-encoded, so its
	characters cannot break the path. An identifier of a ticket that no longer exists resolves
	to no object, and the prefix and the segment leave the address bar again.
	
	The Open list carries a filter bar and demonstrates the other half of the address bar. It
	offers three presets as chips, and the one named by initial= filters the list for a user who
	has not decided about its filtering themselves, so the list opens showing the tickets the
	logged-in user commented on. The chip the list matches is published on the activeFilter
	channel and the text it searches its displayed columns for on the searchTerm channel, and
	<query-bindings> puts the two into the address as filter and q: a list showing a preset is
	the link /view/tickets/ticket/<id>?filter=discussed, a searched one ?q=<term>, and one that
	is both is ?filter=discussed&q=<term>; opening such a link brings the list into that
	state. Both refine the page instead of navigating to a new one - the address bar follows
	along, but the back button leaves the page rather than walking the chips clicked on it. A
	link without the parameters says nothing about the filtering and leaves the list as it
	establishes itself.
	
	The two parameters describe the displayed rows together: a chip selects the rows and the
	search narrows them within that selection, so typing into the search field keeps the chip
	marked and adds q beside filter. Picking a chip, on the other hand, replaces the whole
	filtering, the search term included. Saving the current criteria under a name of one's own
	puts that filter on the bar beside the presets, and it reaches the address exactly like a
	preset, under the identifier it was given - it carries the text that was searched when it was
	saved, so it is the marked one only while exactly that text is searched for again.
	
	The inputs above the lists show that an input is bound to a channel for a value of any type:
	the search term is a tl.core:String and is written in a text field, while the status is an
	enumeration and is chosen from a dropdown of its classifiers. The search term is what a table
	searched from outside looks like - the Open list shows it in the search field of its bar, and
	the Closed list, which displays no bar at all, is searched by it just the same - and either
	list reads the status through its <inputs> and narrows its rows by it.
	
	The third input demonstrates the submit hook: pressing Enter in "Jump to ticket" writes the
	entered text to the jump channel and then runs the <on-submit> command over it, which resolves
	the ticket of that name and writes it to the ticket channel - so the list shows it selected. A
	text is submitted by Enter; the status dropdown beside it would run such a command on every
	choice, since a choice is already finished.
	
	The two lists split the tickets by their status and share the one ticket channel: the
	selected ticket is shown in whichever list holds it, and a ticket that moves between the
	lists leaves the selection empty, because the list that showed it as selected no longer
	has it. "Generate samples" fills them with tickets, some commented by the logged-in user and
	some by somebody else, which is what the presets of the Open list select over: its Comments
	and "Commented by me" columns are computed from a ticket's comments, and a preset filters one
	of them.
	
	Both lists are drag sources and drop targets: dragging a ticket from Open to Closed
	closes it and dragging it back reopens it, which is what each list's <drop> does with the
	tickets dropped on it. Dragging a selected row drags the whole selection, so several
	tickets close in one gesture. The Involve list below them is a row target instead: a
	ticket dropped onto one of its rows gets a comment by that person, and the person dropped
	on arrives on the dropPerson channel that the drop's script reads.
	
	The first list groups its tickets by status, the second one shows them flat, so both
	presentations of the same rows are on screen at once. A group header is a collapsible row
	standing for no ticket: clicking it collapses the group and leaves the selection alone. The
	column header menu of either list regroups it by another column or removes the grouping, and
	that choice is kept per user.
-->
<view>
	<channels>
		<channel name="model"/>
		<channel name="ticket"/>
		<channel name="activeFilter"/>
		<channel name="searchTerm"/>
		<channel name="status"/>
		<channel name="jump"/>
		<channel name="dropPerson"/>
		<derived-channel name="ticketId"
			expr="t -> objectId($t)"
			inputs="ticket"
			reverse="id -> objectResolve(`demo.tickets:Ticket`, $id)"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="ticketState"
			expr="t -> if($t == null, '', if($t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) == `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`, 'closed', 'open'))"
			inputs="ticket"
		/>
	</channels>
	<param-bindings>
		<bind
			channel="ticketId"
			prefix="ticket"
			route-param="ticket"
		/>
	</param-bindings>
	<query-bindings>
		<bind
			channel="activeFilter"
			query-param="filter"
		/>
		<bind
			channel="searchTerm"
			query-param="q"
		/>
	</query-bindings>
	<split-panel
		orientation="horizontal"
		resizable="true"
	>
		<panes>
			<pane
				min-size="220"
				size="30"
				unit="%"
			>
				<panel>
					<title>
						<en>Tickets</en>
						<de>Tickets</de>
					</title>
					<commands>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-magic"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Generate samples</en>
								<de>Beispiele erzeugen</de>
							</label>
							<with-transaction>
								<execute-script function="x -> { areas = ['Login', 'Export', 'Layout', 'Import']; other = all(`tl.accounts:Person`).filter(p -> $p != currentUser()).firstElement(); count(8).foreach(i -> { t = new(`demo.tickets:Ticket`, transient: false); $t.set(`demo.tickets:Ticket#name`, $areas[$i % 4] + ' ' + ($i + 1)); $t.set(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`, if($i % 4 == 3, `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`, `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#open`)); count($i % 3).foreach(j -> { c = new(`demo.tickets:Comment`, $t); $c.set(`demo.tickets:Comment#content`, 'Comment ' + ($j + 1) + '.'); $c.set(`demo.tickets:Comment#author`, if($i % 2 == 0, currentUser(), $other)); $c.set(`demo.tickets:Comment#date`, now()); $t.add(`demo.tickets:Ticket#comments`, $c); }); $t; }); }"/>
							</with-transaction>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-plus-lg"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>New</en>
								<de>Neu</de>
							</label>
							<execute-script function="x -> new(`demo.tickets:Ticket`, transient: true)"/>
							<open-dialog
								bind-input-to="model"
								dialog-view="tickets-create.view.xml"
							>
								<bind
									channel="selection"
									to="ticket"
								/>
							</open-dialog>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-trash"
							input="ticket"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Delete</en>
								<de>Löschen</de>
							</label>
							<executability>
								<null-input-disabled/>
								<disabled-if expr="t -> if($t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) == `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`, #('Closed tickets cannot be deleted.'@en, 'Geschlossene Tickets können nicht gelöscht werden.'@de), null)"/>
							</executability>
							<with-transaction>
								<execute-script function="obj -> { if($obj != null, $obj.delete(), null); null; }"/>
							</with-transaction>
							<write-channel name="ticket"/>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command name="closeTicket"
							image="css:bi bi-check2-circle"
							input="ticket"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Close</en>
								<de>Schließen</de>
							</label>
							<executability>
								<visible-if expr="t -> $t != null &amp;&amp; $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) != `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`"/>
							</executability>
							<with-transaction>
								<execute-script function="t -> $t.set(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`, `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`)"/>
							</with-transaction>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command name="reopenTicket"
							image="css:bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"
							input="ticket"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Reopen</en>
								<de>Wiedereröffnen</de>
							</label>
							<executability>
								<visible-if expr="t -> $t != null &amp;&amp; $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) == `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`"/>
							</executability>
							<with-transaction>
								<execute-script function="t -> $t.set(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`, `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#open`)"/>
							</with-transaction>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command name="toggleTicket"
							image="css:bi bi-toggles"
							input="ticket"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Toggle</en>
								<de>Umschalten</de>
							</label>
							<executability>
								<null-input-disabled/>
							</executability>
							<switch value="t -> $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`)">
								<case match="`demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`">
									<with-transaction>
										<execute-script function="t -> $t.set(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`, `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#open`)"/>
									</with-transaction>
								</case>
								<default>
									<with-transaction>
										<execute-script function="t -> $t.set(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`, `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`)"/>
									</with-transaction>
								</default>
							</switch>
						</generic-command>
					</commands>
					<text input="ticket"/>
					<text
						css-class="ticketState"
						input="ticketState"
					/>
					<progress
						done="x -> all(`demo.tickets:Ticket`).filter(t -> $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) == `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`).size()"
						observed-types="demo.tickets:Ticket"
						total="x -> all(`demo.tickets:Ticket`).size()"
					/>
					<fields>
						<value-input
							type="tl.core:String"
							value="searchTerm"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Search</en>
								<de>Suche</de>
							</label>
						</value-input>
						<value-input
							type="demo.tickets:TicketStatus"
							value="status"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Status</en>
								<de>Status</de>
							</label>
						</value-input>
						<value-input value="jump">
							<label>
								<en>Jump to ticket</en>
								<de>Zu Ticket springen</de>
							</label>
							<on-submit>
								<execute-script function="name -> if($name == null || $name == &quot;&quot;, null, all(`demo.tickets:Ticket`).filter(t -> $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#name`) == $name).firstElement())"/>
								<write-channel name="ticket"/>
							</on-submit>
						</value-input>
					</fields>
					<panel>
						<title>
							<en>Open</en>
							<de>Offen</de>
						</title>
						<table
							active-preset="activeFilter"
							group-by="status"
							observed-types="demo.tickets:Ticket"
							personalization-key="demo-tickets-open"
							search-term="searchTerm"
							selection="ticket"
							types="demo.tickets:Ticket"
						>
							<drag/>
							<drop accept="demo.tickets:Ticket">
								<with-transaction>
									<execute-script function="tickets -> $tickets.foreach(t -> $t.set(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`, `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#open`))"/>
								</with-transaction>
							</drop>
							<inputs>
								<input channel="status"/>
							</inputs>
							<presets initial="mine">
								<preset name="mine">
									<label>
										<en>Commented by me</en>
										<de>Von mir kommentiert</de>
									</label>
									<criterion
										column="commentedByMe"
										expr="true"
									/>
								</preset>
								<preset name="discussed">
									<label>
										<en>Discussed</en>
										<de>Diskutiert</de>
									</label>
									<!-- Written in the form of the column's range filter: more than no comment. -->
									<criterion column="comments">
										<range
											operator="GT"
											primary="0"
										/>
									</criterion>
								</preset>
								<preset name="untouched">
									<label>
										<en>Without comments</en>
										<de>Ohne Kommentare</de>
									</label>
									<!-- A single value the column's range filter reads as an exact match. -->
									<criterion
										column="comments"
										expr="0"
									/>
								</preset>
							</presets>
							<columns>
								<column attribute="name"/>
								<column attribute="status"/>
								<column attribute="statusLabel"/>
								<computed-column name="comments"
									type="tl.core:Integer"
								>
									<label>
										<en>Comments</en>
										<de>Kommentare</de>
									</label>
									<value>t -&gt; $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#comments`).size()</value>
								</computed-column>
								<computed-column name="commentedByMe"
									type="tl.core:Boolean"
								>
									<label>
										<en>Commented by me</en>
										<de>Von mir kommentiert</de>
									</label>
									<value>t -&gt; $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#comments`).filter(c -&gt; $c.get(`demo.tickets:Comment#author`) == currentUser()).size() &gt; 0</value>
								</computed-column>
							</columns>
							<rows>state -&gt; { tickets = all(`demo.tickets:Ticket`).filter(t -&gt; $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) != `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`); if($state == null, $tickets, $tickets.filter(t -&gt; $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) == $state)); }</rows>
						</table>
					</panel>
					<panel>
						<title>
							<en>Closed</en>
							<de>Geschlossen</de>
						</title>
						<table
							observed-types="demo.tickets:Ticket"
							search-term="searchTerm"
							selection="ticket"
							types="demo.tickets:Ticket"
						>
							<drag/>
							<drop accept="demo.tickets:Ticket">
								<with-transaction>
									<execute-script function="tickets -> $tickets.foreach(t -> $t.set(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`, `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`))"/>
								</with-transaction>
							</drop>
							<inputs>
								<input channel="status"/>
							</inputs>
							<columns>
								<column attribute="name"/>
								<column attribute="status"/>
								<column attribute="statusLabel"/>
							</columns>
							<rows>state -&gt; { tickets = all(`demo.tickets:Ticket`).filter(t -&gt; $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) == `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#closed`); if($state == null, $tickets, $tickets.filter(t -&gt; $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) == $state)); }</rows>
						</table>
					</panel>
					<panel>
						<title>
							<en>Involve</en>
							<de>Beteiligen</de>
						</title>
						<table types="tl.accounts:Person">
							<drop
								accept="demo.tickets:Ticket"
								target="row"
								target-channel="dropPerson"
							>
								<with-transaction>
									<execute-script function="person -> tickets -> $tickets.foreach(t -> { c = new(`demo.tickets:Comment`, $t); $c.set(`demo.tickets:Comment#author`, $person); $c.set(`demo.tickets:Comment#content`, &quot;Please have a look.&quot;); $c.set(`demo.tickets:Comment#date`, now()); $t.add(`demo.tickets:Ticket#comments`, $c); })">
										<inputs>
											<input channel="dropPerson"/>
										</inputs>
									</execute-script>
								</with-transaction>
							</drop>
							<columns>
								<column attribute="name"/>
							</columns>
							<rows>all(`tl.accounts:Person`)</rows>
						</table>
					</panel>
				</panel>
			</pane>
			<pane
				size="70"
				unit="%"
			>
				<panel>
					<title>
						<en>Conversation</en>
						<de>Verlauf</de>
					</title>
					<form input="ticket">
						<field attribute="status"/>
					</form>
					<inset>
						<object-list
							element-channel="comment"
							element-type="demo.tickets:Comment"
							inputs="ticket"
							items="ticket -> $ticket.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#comments`)"
							link="ticket -> comment -> { persistent = $comment.copy(transient: false); $persistent.set(`demo.tickets:Comment#author`, currentUser()); $persistent.set(`demo.tickets:Comment#date`, now()); $ticket.add(`demo.tickets:Ticket#comments`, $persistent); }"
							new-element-channel="newComment"
							remove="ticket -> comment -> $comment.delete()"
						>
							<item>
								<view-ref view="tickets/comment.view.xml">
									<bind
										channel="comment"
										to="comment"
									/>
									<bind
										channel="draft"
										to="newComment"
									/>
								</view-ref>
							</item>
							<new-element>
								<view-ref view="tickets/comment-composer.view.xml">
									<bind
										channel="comment"
										to="newComment"
									/>
									<bind
										channel="ticket"
										to="ticket"
									/>
								</view-ref>
							</new-element>
							<empty-text>
								<en>No comments yet.</en>
								<de>Noch keine Kommentare.</de>
							</empty-text>
						</object-list>
					</inset>
				</panel>
			</pane>
		</panes>
	</split-panel>
</view>